o packet loss observed.\n\n#### Diagnosis:\nThe network exhibits localized communication issues between Host_1 and Host_5. While other hosts can successfully communicate with Host_5, Host_1 is unable to establish connectivity. This suggests potential issues with:\n   - Host_1's network configuration or connectivity.\n   - Host_5's network configuration or connectivity.\n   - The edge switches (switch_1 and switch_5) connected to Host_1 and Host_5, respectively.\n   - The central switch (switch_0) or its links to switch_1 and switch_5.\n\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the anomaly.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 4130, "output_tokens": 606, "total_tokens": 4736, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 2816}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
